WEBVTT

00:20:28.765 --> 00:20:32.477
travel to other provinces,
to countries outside Afghanistan

00:20:32.477 --> 00:20:33.770
without a man."

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:39.943
So it means that Taliban do not count
women as humans or equal to men.

00:20:39.943 --> 00:20:43.655
So there should be a man
to validate that they exist.

00:20:44.572 --> 00:20:46.908
And they say that,
"We lost everything we had.

00:20:46.908 --> 00:20:48.535
And that's why we are fighting.

00:20:48.576 --> 00:20:51.204
We are not afraid to die,

00:20:51.246 --> 00:20:53.373
but it makes us happy

00:20:54.457 --> 00:20:55.875
and encourages us

00:20:55.917 --> 00:20:59.546
when we see women,
no matter Afghans, non-Afghans

00:20:59.587 --> 00:21:01.089
from outside the country,